{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51751","headline":"咏有年官健 · 令狐峤","name":"咏有年官健","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六十休论少壮时，尉迟功业拟奚爲。\n高声念佛寻街者，尽是抝（一作拘）停老健儿。\n（以上《监诫录》四《蜀门讽》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51751.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51751","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}